  "details": "1. Open Settings from Main Menu in desktop mode.\n\n2. Make sure \"Always Show VRChat Soft Keyboard\" is enabled in User Interface → General UI Settings.\n\n3. Search for \"soft\".\n\nExpected result: The soft keyboard is centered to the window.\n\nActual result: The keyboard is docked to left of the inner settings panel and overflows the window (1024x768 resolution).",
